  statsHeading: In Singapore
  statsBody: 'The chaos you just experienced isn''t just a simulation.


    1 in
    3 youths in Singapore experience severe symptoms of depression, anxiety, or stress.


    1
    in 7 people will live through a mental health condition in their lifetime.


    The
    hardest step is reaching out. You do not have to carry it alone.

'
  statsFootnote: 'Institute of Mental Health, National Youth Mental Health Study
    2024

    Singapore Mental Health Study 2016'
  hotlineHeading: If any of that felt familiar
  hotlineBody: "SOS  Samaritans of Singapore\n1767   \xB7   24 hours\nCareText on
    WhatsApp   9151 1767\n\nmindline.sg\n1771   \xB7   24 hours\n\nIMH Mental Health
    Helpline\n6389 2222   \xB7   24 hours\n\nTinkle Friend  (ages 7 to 12)\n1800
    274 4788\n\nEmergency   995"
  endLine: You are not alone.
